  'emergency_medicine', 'integrative', 'neurology', 'adult',
  'AHA/ASA Guidelines for Early Management of Acute Ischemic Stroke 2019 Update; DAWN trial NEJM 2018; DEFUSE-3 NEJM 2018', 'AI-generated-board-seed', true, 'seeded via Claude Code session (no critique pass)'
