V/S: BP 116/74, HR 80
Gen: well, mild fatigue
Fetal: heart 152, growth appropriate
Lab: TSH 4.8 (trimester-specific upper limit < 2.5 1st trimester, < 3.0 2nd-3rd), FT4 low-normal, TPO Ab positive (Hashimoto)'
  );

