V/S: BP 116/72, HR 80
Gen: 3 cm left breast mass, no node
Fetal: heart present, dating correct, anatomy scan planned 20 wk
Lab: routine WNL
Pathology: invasive ductal carcinoma, ER+ PR+ HER2-, Ki-67 30%'
