V/S: BP 132/82, HR 116, RR 18, Temp 36.9
Gen: tremor, warm skin, no exophthalmos
Lab: TSH < 0.01, FT4 high, T3 high, TPO Ab positive, TRAb negative, RAIU low (1%), Thyroid US: small + mildly hypoechoic + no nodule'
