Fetal: FHR 144, EFW 600 g (50th)
Lab: HIV negative, Sputum AFB smear 3+, Xpert MTB/RIF positive — rifampin-sensitive, CXR: bilateral upper lobe infiltrates + cavities + no effusion
TST/IGRA positive'
