Lab: plt 110 (down from 240 baseline), AST/ALT WNL, Cr 1.1, uric acid 7.5, urine protein/Cr 4.5, anti-dsDNA elevated × 3-fold from baseline, low C3/C4, anti-Ro/La positive (known), aPL negative'
