US hip: joint effusion left hip 6 mm
Kocher criteria: fever > 38.5 (+), non-weight bearing (+), ESR > 40 (+), WBC > 12,000 (+) = 4/4 criteria → 99% probability septic arthritis

Hip aspiration: WBC 110,000 (PMN 92%) — septic arthritis'
