V/S: HR 132, BP 88/58, RR 32, SpO2 92%, BW 28 kg
Gen: cachectic, JVD, S3 gallop, hepatomegaly 5 cm, bilateral pretibial pitting edema, cool extremities, prolonged cap refill 4 sec

