Urine: osmolality 380 (HIGHER than serum — inappropriately concentrated), urine Na 60 (HIGH for hyponatremia)
UO normal 1.2 mL/kg/hr; clinically euvolemic
TSH normal, cortisol normal (post-op on stress steroid)'
